{"content":[{"c":["BARACHIAH, BARACHIAS*"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Name attributed in the NT to Zechariah’s father (",{"href":"?bref=Matt.23.35","r":"Matt.23.35","rawR":"Matt.23.35","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Matt.23.35","value":"Matt.23.35"}],"t":"ref","v":"Mt 23:35"},"). Zechariah, executed in the temple by order of King Joash, was said to be the son of Jehoiada (",{"href":"?bref=2Chr.24.20-22","r":"2Chr.24.20-22","rawR":"2Chr.24.20-22","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Chr.24.20-22","value":"2Chr.24.20-22"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Chr 24:20-22"},"). “Son of Barachiah” could be a copyist’s addition, since in the parallel passage in Luke’s Gospel (",{"href":"?bref=Luke.11.51","r":"Luke.11.51","rawR":"Luke.11.51","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Luke.11.51","value":"Luke.11.51"}],"t":"ref","v":"Lk 11:51"},") the name does not appear in the most reliable manuscripts. A copyist may have confused the martyred Zechariah with the postexilic prophet Zechariah, whose father was Berechiah (",{"href":"?bref=Zech.1.1,7","r":"Zech.1.1,7","rawR":"Zech.1.1,7","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Zech.1.1,7","value":"Zech.1.1,7"}],"t":"ref","v":"Zec 1:1, 7"},")."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"BarachiahBarachias","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Mt 23:35","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Matt.23.35","rawQueryValue":"Matt.23.35","sourceRefExact":"Matt.23.35"},{"anchorText":"2 Chr 24:20-22","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Chr.24.20-22","rawQueryValue":"2Chr.24.20-22","sourceRefExact":"2Chr.24.20-22"},{"anchorText":"Lk 11:51","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Luke.11.51","rawQueryValue":"Luke.11.51","sourceRefExact":"Luke.11.51"},{"anchorText":"Zec 1:1, 7","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Zech.1.1,7","rawQueryValue":"Zech.1.1,7","sourceRefExact":"Zech.1.1,7"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"0003a53623c323a7bacc37f4fe76bde15b938476d76487529ddbbf6b9b263ea0","sourceItemName":"BarachiahBarachias","sourceItemOrder":75,"sourceMember":"Articles/B.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"BarachiahBarachias","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Barachiah, Barachias*","title":"Barachiah, Barachias*","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}